----------------------------------------------------------------------
The IT / S3M engine (src/it/) is modplay-rs's own code, written against the
behaviour of OpenMPT / libopenmpt (https://openmpt.org/). It reproduces
formulas and tables from OpenMPT's soundlib, among them the resonant filter
coefficients (SetupChannelFilter), the default MIDI macro configuration and
the legacy mix-level pre-amp table. OpenMPT is licensed as follows:

Copyright (c) 2004-2026, OpenMPT Project Developers and Contributors
Copyright (c) 1997-2003, Olivier Lapicque
All rights reserved.

Redistribution and use in source and binary forms, with or without
modification, are permitted provided that the following conditions are met:
    * Redistributions of source code must retain the above copyright
      notice, this list of conditions and the following disclaimer.
